    - Name: SpiritImage
      Entry: 10
      Data: 3
    - Name: dialogueText
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Right now, we can only see the engineer\u2019s prosthetic layer, but
        we don\u2019t know which prosthetics need to be scanned or where they are
        located on his body\u2026"
